{"id":"a9434ef141555c38","group":"90","path":"90/90-lem-substitution.md","title":"Substitution Lemma","display":"lem-substitution — Substitution Lemma","type":"lemma","metadata":{"type":"lemma","book":"Diagonalization and Self-Reference","book_abbrev":"90","label":"90-lem-substitution","aliases":["90-lem-substitution"],"display":"lem-substitution — Substitution Lemma","depends_on":["[[90-df-substitution-function]]","[[90-df-godel-numbering]]","[[90-df-formula]]","[[90-df-numeral]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"lemma"},{"key":"book","html":"Diagonalization and Self-Reference"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"90"},{"key":"label","html":"90-lem-substitution"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>90-lem-substitution</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"lem-substitution — Substitution Lemma"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"7279c20158ac140e\" href=\"?note=7279c20158ac140e\" title=\"90-df-substitution-function\">90-df-substitution-function</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"b86b211a75cf1748\" href=\"?note=b86b211a75cf1748\" title=\"90-df-godel-numbering\">90-df-godel-numbering</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"4ce2b2789d377e1f\" href=\"?note=4ce2b2789d377e1f\" title=\"90-df-formula\">90-df-formula</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"d53b945955293235\" href=\"?note=d53b945955293235\" title=\"90-df-numeral\">90-df-numeral</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p>指定变量 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"v\">\\(v\\)</span> 与 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"7279c20158ac140e\" href=\"?note=7279c20158ac140e\" title=\"90-df-substitution-function\">90-df-substitution-function</a> 中固定的变量相同，且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\\supseteq S_{\\mathrm{arith}}\">\\(S\\supseteq S_{\\mathrm{arith}}\\)</span>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\">\\(S\\)</span> (effective arithmetical signature)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi(v)\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S^{(1)}\">\\(\\varphi(v)\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S^{(1)}\\)</span> (formula with designated free variable <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"v\">\\(v\\)</span>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(n\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span></p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"g:\\operatorname{Expr}(S)\\to\\mathbb N\">\\(g:\\operatorname{Expr}(S)\\to\\mathbb N\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"d:\\mathbb N\\rightharpoonup\\operatorname{Expr}(S)\">\\(d:\\mathbb N\\rightharpoonup\\operatorname{Expr}(S)\\)</span></p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{GN}_{\\operatorname{Expr}(S)}(g,d)\">\\(\\mathrm{GN}_{\\operatorname{Expr}(S)}(g,d)\\)</span> (effective Gödel numbering)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Sub}_S:\\mathbb N^2\\to\\mathbb N\">\\(\\mathrm{Sub}_S:\\mathbb N^2\\to\\mathbb N\\)</span> (coded substitution function, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"7279c20158ac140e\" href=\"?note=7279c20158ac140e\" title=\"90-df-substitution-function\">90-df-substitution-function</a>)</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}substitution}\\ \\vdash\\\n\\mathrm{GN}_{\\operatorname{Expr}(S)}(g,d)\\Longrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Sub}_S\\bigl(g(\\varphi(v)),n\\bigr)\n=g\\bigl(\\varphi[\\overline n/v]\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}substitution}\\ \\vdash\\\n\\mathrm{GN}_{\\operatorname{Expr}(S)}(g,d)\\Longrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Sub}_S\\bigl(g(\\varphi(v)),n\\bigr)\n=g\\bigl(\\varphi[\\overline n/v]\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Proof\">[Proof]</h2>\n<p>令 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"e=g(\\varphi)\">\\(e=g(\\varphi)\\)</span>。由有效编号的单射性，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"e\">\\(e\\)</span> 解码为这一且仅这一公式；它恰有指定自由变量 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"v\">\\(v\\)</span>，故代入函数采用合法公式分支，唯一返回 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"g(\\varphi[\\overline n/v])\">\\(g(\\varphi[\\overline n/v])\\)</span>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>等式两侧都是自然数编码；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi[\\overline n/v]\">\\(\\varphi[\\overline n/v]\\)</span> 才是对象语言公式。</li>\n<li>指定被替换变量可避免捕获歧义；这里的数码记作 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\overline n\">\\(\\overline n\\)</span>。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Proof","text":"[Proof]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"90-df-substitution-function","status":"resolved","id":"7279c20158ac140e","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[90-df-substitution-function]]","embed":false},{"target":"90-df-godel-numbering","status":"resolved","id":"b86b211a75cf1748","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[90-df-godel-numbering]]","embed":false},{"target":"90-df-formula","status":"resolved","id":"4ce2b2789d377e1f","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[90-df-formula]]","embed":false},{"target":"90-df-numeral","status":"resolved","id":"d53b945955293235","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[90-df-numeral]]","embed":false},{"target":"90-df-substitution-function","status":"resolved","id":"7279c20158ac140e","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"指定变量 $v$ 与 [[90-df-substitution-function]] 中固定的变量相同，且 $S\\supseteq S_{\\mathrm{arith}}$。","embed":false},{"target":"90-df-substitution-function","status":"resolved","id":"7279c20158ac140e","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Sub}_S:\\mathbb N^2\\to\\mathbb N$ (coded substitution function, see [[90-df-substitution-function]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"v","display":false},{"tex":"S\\supseteq S_{\\mathrm{arith}}","display":false},{"tex":"S","display":false},{"tex":"\\varphi(v)\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S^{(1)}","display":false},{"tex":"v","display":false},{"tex":"n\\in\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"g:\\operatorname{Expr}(S)\\to\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"d:\\mathbb N\\rightharpoonup\\operatorname{Expr}(S)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{GN}_{\\operatorname{Expr}(S)}(g,d)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Sub}_S:\\mathbb N^2\\to\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}substitution}\\ \\vdash\\\n\\mathrm{GN}_{\\operatorname{Expr}(S)}(g,d)\\Longrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Sub}_S\\bigl(g(\\varphi(v)),n\\bigr)\n=g\\bigl(\\varphi[\\overline n/v]\\bigr).","display":true},{"tex":"e=g(\\varphi)","display":false},{"tex":"e","display":false},{"tex":"v","display":false},{"tex":"g(\\varphi[\\overline n/v])","display":false},{"tex":"\\varphi[\\overline n/v]","display":false},{"tex":"\\overline n","display":false}],"bytes":1529,"backlinks":[{"id":"32c1f47762a7f658","anchor":"ref-120","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[90-lem-kleene-normal.md]]\n[[90-lem-lob.md]]\n[[90-lem-norm-fixed-point.md]]\n[[90-lem-parameterized-recursion.md]]\n[[90-lem-program-numbering.md]]\n[[90-lem-q-finite-comparison.md]]\n[[90-lem-sequence-coding.md]]\n[[90-lem-substitution.md]]\n[[90-lem-t-predicate.md]]"}],"outgoing":["7279c20158ac140e","b86b211a75cf1748","4ce2b2789d377e1f","d53b945955293235"]}